  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1017.01 Purpose. The purpose of Ed 1017 is to provide uniform application of 45 CFR 1329 regarding state independent living services and centers for independent living.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
